<title>AUSTRIA: Wolford 6-mth sales up, sees 1996/7 up too.</title>
<headline>Wolford 6-mth sales up, sees 1996/7 up too.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian luxury hosiery maker Wolford said on Thursday group sales in the six months to end October rose seven percent to 832 million schillings.</p>
<p>In a statement the firm forecast group full-year sales would be 1.7 billion schillings, compared with 1.475 billion in 1995/6.</p>
<p>Wolford will announce full first half earnings on December 16.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
